The type ChatCompletionsClient is from the Azure.AI.Inference namespace, likely from an external Azure SDK package, so it is not defined in this repo. I will update the test to mock it as a class from that namespace and use Moq.Protected to mock the necessary methods if needed. I will also add the necessary using directives and fix the test to build correctly.

I will submit a corrected test file now. It will focus on the AddAzureAIInferenceChatCompletion extension method that takes a ChatCompletionsClient? parameter and test the behavior of the service provider's GetRequiredService call on line 133 indirectly by passing null chatClient and verifying the service provider is called to get the ChatCompletionsClient.

